OL,3,GNEWSAHow Salisbury voters could decide
OL,4,Acounty's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Salisbury Milford ward, home to
OL,7,Fabout 6,000 people, stretches to the
OL,8,Feast of the medieval city centre, with
OL,9,Fthe train line on one side and the A36
OL,10,Fon the other.
OL,12,FIt has plenty of current and former
OL,13,Fcouncil homes, as well some of the most
OL,14,Fexpensive houses in the city.
OL,16,FPeople here are being asked to vote for
OL,17,Fwho they want as their new councillor
OL,18,Fand the result could decide who runs
OL,19,FWiltshire Council.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
